            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Gujarati for a valley, then the Gujarati for a hill."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: રણ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "રણ (raṇ) — \"a desert\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of રણ (raṇ) is not settled. It matches Sindhi riñu, \"wilderness, desert\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit iriṇya, \"relating to desert\" (CDIAL 600). CDIAL lists Gujarati rān, \"wild; forest, desert\", under the first word of that entry, araṇya, but not રણ (raṇ) itself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for this chapter."
